## Get HLS Playlist

```
GET /stream/:id/playlist.m3u8
```

Returns the HLS manifest file for a track. No authentication required.

### Path Parameters

| Parameter | Type | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `id` | string | Track ID |

### Response

Returns `application/vnd.apple.mpegurl` content:

```
#EXTM3U
#EXT-X-TARGETDURATION:10
#EXTINF:10.0,
segment-000.ts
#EXTINF:10.0,
segment-001.ts
...
#EXT-X-ENDLIST
```

## Get Audio Segment

```
GET /stream/:id/:segment
```

Returns an individual HLS audio segment. No authentication required.

### Path Parameters

| Parameter | Type | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `id` | string | Track ID |
| `segment` | string | Segment filename (e.g., `segment-000.ts`) |

### Response

Returns `video/mp2t` binary data.

## Usage with HLS.js

```javascript
import Hls from 'hls.js';

const hls = new Hls();
hls.loadSource('/stream/track-uuid/playlist.m3u8');
hls.attachMedia(audioElement);
```
